{{DisambigPage|Lunar New Year}}
'''Lunar New Year''' may refer to:
*[[Lunar New Year]], the event that is based on the [[:wikipedia:Chinese New Year|Chinese New Year]].
*[[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)]], the Event Gacha for the Lunar New Year event.
*[[Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's]], the event that grants Legendary Charms to spin the Lunar New Year Event Capsule.
*[[Lunar New Year's Gifts Galore!]], a stage appearing during the Lunar New Year event that grants 20 [[Cat Food]] a day.
*[[A Colossal New Year!]], a [[Gauntlet]] that appears during the Lunar New Year event, featuring various year-themed [[Doge]] variants and [[Sunrise Doge]].
*[[New Year's Bling]], another event on during the Lunar New Year Event featuring the [[Large White Ball|three]] [[Large Red Ball|ball]] [[Large Iron Ball|enemies]] that grants large amounts of [[XP Function|XP]].
*[[Lunar New Year's Capsules (Gacha Event)]], a Rare Cat Capsule event containing various [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] made to celebrate the Lunar New Year event.
*[[Lunar New Year Sale Scuffle]], an event that appears during special occasions that is also named after the Lunar New Year.
**[[Lunar New Year Blowout]], the first stage of the Lunar New Year Sale Scuffle event.
*[[Happy New Year? (Monthly Event)]], a Monthly Event featuring [[Lucky Sloth]] which grants [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|Evil Cat]].
*[[Another New Year (Monthly Event)]], the second half of the Happy New Year? event, featuring [[Sister Lione]].
*[[Years-End Neneko (Super Rare Cat)]], a variant of [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]], whose Evolved Form is named New Year Neneko.
*[[New Years Event]], a Yearly event that appears once the Year's End Event ends.
*[[Year's End Event]], a Yearly event that appears around one week before the New Year begins.